406\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u5358\u4f4d\u306e \u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u8a8d\u8a3c \uff08IEEE 802.1x + MAB\uff09\u3092 SONiC \u306b\u6301\u3061\u8fbc\u3080\u6a5f\u80fd\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/port-access-control-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T21:30:02+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sflow-test-plan/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sflow-test-plan/", "title": "sFlow \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08hsflowd + 2 collector / sampling rate / agent-id / counter polling\uff09", "content_html": "sFlow \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08hsflowd + 2 collector / sampling rate / agent-id / counter polling\uff09 \u2014 T0 \u4e0a\u3067 SONiC sFlow \u6a5f\u80fd\u3092\u6a5f\u80fd\u691c\u8a3c\u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sflow-test-plan.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T20:51:35+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/", "title": "SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD \u6982\u5ff5\uff08actor model \u3068 vDPU \u62bd\u8c61\uff09", "content_html": "HAMgrD \u306e\u6982\u5ff5\u3002NPU \u5074 actor model\u3001vDPU \u62bd\u8c61\u3001HA Set / HA Scope \u306e\u5f79\u5272\u3001DPU-Driven / Switch-Driven mode \u306e\u9055\u3044\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:40:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/", "title": "\u521d\u5b66\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "SONiC \u3092\u521d\u3081\u3066\u89e6\u308b\u8aad\u8005\u5411\u3051\u3002\u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca / Redis DB / SAI / \u8a2d\u5b9a\u53cd\u6620\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u306e\u8f2a\u90ed\u3068\u3001\u5404 area \u3078\u306e\u5c0e\u7dda\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/beginner.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/", "title": "\u904b\u7528\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "\u904b\u7528\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9 \u2014 \u65e2\u306b SONiC \u3092\u904b\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u8aad\u8005\u3092\u60f3\u5b9a\u3057\u305f\u5165\u53e3\u3002\u65e5\u3005\u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u5909\u66f4\u3001\u969c\u5bb3\u8abf\u67fb\u3001CONFIG_DB \u306e\u610f\u5473\u78ba\u8a8d\u3001show techsupport \u3084\u30ed\u30b0\u30fb\u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u306e\u4f7f\u3044\u65b9\u306b\u52a0\u3048\u3001\u75c7\u72b6\u5225\u306e\u9006\u5f15\u304d\u8868\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/operator.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/p4-orchagent/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/p4-orchagent/", "title": "P4Orch\uff08PINS \u306e P4Runtime \u7528 orchagent / \u540c\u671f\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\uff09", "content_html": "P4Orch \u306f PINS (P4 Integrated Network Stack) \u306e\u4e2d\u6838 orchagent\u3002APPL_DB.P4RT \u3092\u8cfc\u8aad\u3057\u3001SAI \u3092\u540c\u671f\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u3067\u53e9\u3044\u3066 P4Runtime controller \u306b\u5b8c\u4e86\u5fdc\u7b54\u3092\u8fd4\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/p4-orchagent.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T16:40:23+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/port-storm-control/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/port-storm-control/", "title": "PORT_STORM_CONTROL \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "PORT_STORM_CONTROL \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 \u7269\u7406\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3067 BUM (broadcast / unknown-unicast / unknown-multicast) \u30c8\u30e9\u30d5\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u306e\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u5236\u9650 (storm control) \u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/port-storm-control.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:04:35+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/", "title": "SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 SYSLOG_CONFIG.GLOBAL \u306e rate-limit \u3092 FEATURE (docker) \u3054\u3068\u306b\u4e0a\u66f8\u304d\u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:00:11+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/routing-loop-detected/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/routing-loop-detected/", "title": "Routing loop \u304c\u767a\u751f\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b", "content_html": "Runbook: traceroute \u304c\u540c\u4e00 hop \u3092\u7e70\u308a\u8fd4\u3057\u3001TTL exceeded \u3068 control plane CPU \u304c\u6025\u4e0a\u6607\u3059\u308b routing loop \u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u3068\u5bfe\u51e6\u624b\u9806\u3002FRR zebra RIB / sonic-swss routeorch \u3092\u6839\u62e0\u306b static / BGP \u7d4c\u8def\u306e\u7af6\u5408\u3092\u8a3a\u65ad\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/routing-loop-detected.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:51:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/routing-and-next-hop-table-enhancement/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/routing-and-next-hop-table-enhancement/", "title": "NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE \u306b\u3088\u308b APP_DB \u30eb\u30fc\u30c8\u3068\u30cd\u30af\u30b9\u30c8\u30db\u30c3\u30d7\u5206\u96e2", "content_html": "NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE \u306b\u3088\u308b APP_DB \u30eb\u30fc\u30c8\u3068\u30cd\u30af\u30b9\u30c8\u30db\u30c3\u30d7\u5206\u96e2 \u2014 \u5f93\u6765\u306e SONiC \u306f APP_DB.ROUTE_TABLE \u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306b\u30cd\u30af\u30b9\u30c8\u30db\u30c3\u30d7\u60c5\u5831 (nexthop / ifname) \u3092 \u76f4\u63a5\u57cb\u3081\u8fbc\u3093\u3067 \u3044\u305f\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/routing-and-next-hop-table-enhancement.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:16:38+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft/", "title": "VRF \u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\uff08vrfmgrd / vrforch / FRR vrf-aware\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e VRF \u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306f\u3001Linux kernel \u306e VRF master device \u3092\u57fa\u76e4\u306b\u3001FRR (zebra / bgpd) \u3092 vrf-aware \u5316\u3057\u3001SONiC \u5074\u306b vrfmgrd / vrforch \u3092\u65b0\u8a2d\u3057\u3066 L3 interface\u30fbstatic route\u30fbBGP \u30bb\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30fbACL redirect \u306e VRF binding \u3092\u4e00\u6c17\u901a\u8cab\u3067\u6271\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T21:05:37+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/mclag-enhancements-concepts/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/mclag-enhancements-concepts/", "title": "MCLAG Enhancements \u6982\u5ff5\uff087 \u8ef8\u62e1\u5f35\u30fbisolation group / unique IP\uff09", "content_html": "MCLAG Enhancements \u306e\u6982\u5ff5\u6574\u7406\u3002dynamic config / timer \u8a2d\u5b9a / static MAC / aging disable / MAC sync \u6700\u9069\u5316 / isolation group / unique IP \u306e 7 \u8ef8\u3092\u8981\u4ef6\u30fb\u30e6\u30fc\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30b9\u306e\u89b3\u70b9\u3067\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/mclag-enhancements-concepts.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T04:42:54+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-26T06:06:05+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/system-ready-hld/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/system-ready-hld/", "title": "System Ready\uff08sysmonitor + per-app closest UP status \u306e event \u96c6\u7d04\uff09", "content_html": "System Ready \u2014 SONiC \u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u306f\u975e\u540c\u671f\u3067\u3001systemd \u306e service \u304c active \u3067\u3082\u5185\u90e8\u306e SWSS \u7cfb daemon \u304c CONFIG_DB \u3092\u6d88\u5316\u3057 ASIC \u306b\u5c4a\u304f\u307e\u3067\u6642\u9593\u304c\u639b\u304b\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001sysmonitor \u304c closest UP status \u3092\u96c6\u7d04\u3057\u3066 1 \u3064\u306e ready \u72b6\u614b\u3092\u516c\u958b\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/system-ready-hld.png", "